# covers: 0b 1.5, 1a 2.2
# 0b-click-move: three click-to-move orders, each Acked by the server, each reconciling the
# own position within 1 tile of the destination.
#
# Timeouts (R1): an Ack is one round trip plus a 100 ms tick, 5 s is generous. Walking: the
# server's default speed covers the 1-kill scenario's 57 tiles in ~10 s; these legs are <= 30
# tiles, so 15 s is 3x.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.ClickMove 10 10
nf.WaitFor acks >= 1 5
nf.WaitFor own_at 10 10 1 15
nf.ClickMove 25 5
nf.WaitFor acks >= 2 5
nf.WaitFor own_at 25 5 1 15
nf.ClickMove 5 20
nf.WaitFor acks >= 3 5
nf.WaitFor own_at 5 20 1 15
nf.Expect rejected == none
nf.Within 75
